  "second_temple_context": "",
  "canonical_context": "Psalm 27 uses light as an image of the Lord’s protection. John 1 connects light with life and the Word; Ephesians 5 uses light language for transformed conduct; 1 John 1 connects walking in light with truthful fellowship and confession. The passages share an image but develop it for different purposes.",
